  "guidedHint": "Four problems, four answers. Downloads: a CDN in front of Object Storage. Abusive clients: a Client Limit on the API Gateway. Uploads: connect the users straight to Object Storage. A Region that falls: a standby Region and a DNS with a short TTL (10 s is enough). Check that the DNS reaches both Regions.",
